GNU Unifont 16.0.04, single-width PSF2 face
===========================================

unifont-16.0.04-8x16.psf2 is not an upstream file. Upstream publishes no
full-coverage PSF2 -- its only PSF is Unifont-APL8x16-16.0.04.psf.gz, which is
PSF1 (magic 0x0436) and covers APL alone. This face is derived from the
upstream .hex release by td-compositor/tools/import-unifont.rs, which pins the
input by hash and is what makes the derivation reproducible.

